<section xmlns:xi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XInclude" xml:id="sec_preface">
  <title>Preface</title>
  <p>This front matter collects the opening notes that help orient readers before the main chapters begin.</p>

  <subsection xml:id="sub_frontmatter_students">
    <title>For Students</title>
    <p>Read the examples, work the practice problems, and use the exercises to check your understanding as you go.</p>
  </subsection>

  <subsection xml:id="sub_frontmatter_instructors">
    <title>For Instructors</title>
    <p>The material is designed to be flexible, so you can choose the sections and activities that fit your course goals.</p>
  </subsection>

